id: pm-swarm-resource-reservations
title: Reserve explicit shared resources with fenced tracker leases
description: "Acceptance: exclusive resource ownership cannot overlap; expired or stale tokens cannot publish; backend refusal never silently falls back to local coordination. Add a backend-neutral typed SDK model, agent-sized CLI TOON/JSON, typed remedies, README and example, non-Git real public tracker copy validation, behavioral revert proof and CI npm/Bun release evidence. Builds on PR #12 and must merge after it."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T21:01:06.878Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T22:29:35.562Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[24]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T21:01:11.602Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: core CLI exposes item claim/release and SDK locks/workspace transactions, not named non-file resource reservations. PR #12 owns shared operation lease correctness and fenced item handoff. pm-rl process.ts reserveProcessJob reserves trainer budget allowances per job, not exclusive named environments, ports, datasets or deployment slots. This feature reuses tracker claims and #12 operation leases, adds a resource model and refuses unsupported backend coordination; no worktree lanes are added. Registry reports pm CLI 2026.10.21; tracker writes use the pinned 2026.10.17 host."
  "2026-10-21T21:06:36.873Z",codex-agent,"Design: one explicitly tagged resource item per physical slot, using native assignee plus the existing decimal swarm_token and a durable resource expiry. Reserve, renew, release and bounded publication update through the same operation lease as PR #12 claims. Resource items are excluded from work selection and stale-agent recovery. A typed ResourceBackend owns serialization and atomic publication; its refusal propagates with no fallback. The built-in local tracker adapter refuses service-capable storage configurations before creating a local operation pin. Hosted provider acceptance is not claimed."
  "2026-10-21T21:10:14.329Z",codex-agent,"Public-corpus proof passed: committed public pm-ops tracker at eba7d5262fd75e67afce0caad29dae7dc7dfbaeb; 146 certified items, 300 baseline files, 3689055 bytes made read-only in a non-Git scratch tracker. One new synthetic resource completed 7 successful mutations, 1 busy refusal and 1 stale refusal, ending generation 4. All 300 baseline SHA-256 digests remained unchanged. Compact final JSON was 89 bytes. Measured coordination/read phase: 41224 ms; test case: 42723 ms. Git was absent from PATH for the actual CLI status check. No source tracker or hosted data was changed."
  "2026-10-21T21:11:10.154Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs: independent disposable source copies retained the real tracker tests and pinned SDK. Removing only ResourceReservations.reserve exclusivity made node --test --test-name-pattern=\"resources on one non-Git tracker\" test/resources.test.ts fail 0/1 with missing resource_busy rejection. Removing only ResourceReservations.fence ownership/expiry check made node --test --test-name-pattern=\"expired resources admit\" test/resources.test.ts fail 0/1 with missing resource_stale_fence rejection. Removing only trackerResourceBackend supported-provider refusal made node --test --test-name-pattern=\"resource backend refusal propagates\" test/resources.test.ts fail 0/1 with missing resource_backend_refused rejection. Each exit was 1 with zero cancellations; source imports require no dist rebuild. The working implementation was never reverted."
  "2026-10-21T21:13:42.628Z",codex-agent,"Targeted c8 run passed 7/7 tests with zero failures/skips/cancellations; both new resource modules measured 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines. Exact command: node_modules/.bin/c8 --include=src/resources.ts --include=src/resource-tracker.ts --reporter=text --reporter=json --reports-dir=coverage/resources node --test test/resources.test.ts. Loaded-host total was 189019 ms. Earlier aggregate PM-linked run timed out at the unchanged 120-second limit after four passing cases and is failed evidence. Linked commands are now split by SDK, native CLI and process scenarios without dropping cases or raising deadlines. Typecheck, lint, docstrings, zero duplication and identity checks passed; full npm/Bun gates will run in CI."
  "2026-10-21T21:17:13.819Z",codex-agent,"PR #15 is ready for review at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/pull/15, base main, explicitly dependent on #12. Source commit 85fca39 was pushed only to feat/resource-reservations after merging the latest prerequisite branch (already up to date). CI release run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/39677319757. Final split PM-linked evidence: SDK selector tracker|expired|validation|backend|records passes 5/5 via pm test --run --only-index 1 --progress (15144 ms); CLI passes 1/1 (35925 ms), process contention passes 1/1 (14674 ms). All passing executions have zero failures/skips/cancellations. The SDK rerun includes the missing/empty capability declaration refusal correction; an earlier SDK attempt failed that new regression before the correction. Result tracking is disabled by existing project policy, so receipts are recorded here. No new PM CLI/SDK bug was identified."
  "2026-10-21T21:18:30.990Z",codex-agent,"CI attempt 39677319757 on 85fca39 failed one existing documentation regression: the README sentence no longer matched its assigned-item contract assertion. Node 26 reported 190/191 tests passing and 100/100/100/100 coverage across all 27 authored files; failed suite status correctly blocked remaining release steps. Restored the required assigned-item wording and stated the tagged resource exception immediately afterwards. No assertion, source behavior, deadline or threshold was changed. Added the exact focused documentation command to this item."
  "2026-10-21T21:22:34.977Z",codex-agent,"Final-source revert refresh on f340c88: exclusivity, fence and backend-refusal mutants each again fail 0/1 by assertion with exit 1 and zero cancellations, retaining the current real tracker tests. An additional mutant reverts only the resource filter in Swarm.readyCandidates; node --test --test-name-pattern=\"resource records never\" test/resources.test.ts fails 0/1 because a resource is incorrectly selected and reaches the independent resource-start refusal. The guard prevents a work claim, but the no-resource-selection regression still fails. No working source was reverted. Corrected README PM-linked regression passes 1/1 in 15155 ms."
  "2026-10-21T21:25:56.682Z",codex-agent,"Complete CI release gate passed on f340c885b1e07f12c1796c74979e829b9da8a47f: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/39677832478. Node 22 npm steps: 191/191 source tests plus 3/3 packed acceptance. Node 26 npm steps: 191/191 plus 3/3. Complete bun run release:check: 191/191 plus 3/3. Every suite has zero failures/skips/cancellations. Coverage remains 100/100/100/100 across all 27 authored files, unchanged thresholds; 81 declarations documented, zero duplication, zero production vulnerabilities, strict CI tracker health and all remaining gates pass. All package dry runs have shasum b6927438f55439898744d9340920644f8a4f9fc3. Verification receipt retains failed attempts and exact scoped proof boundaries. Final handoff is documentation and append-only PM evidence only; claim will be released, item remains in progress. No merge/release, no new PM CLI/SDK defect."
  "2026-10-21T21:26:46.028Z",codex-agent,"The required final pre-push fetch found prerequisite #12 advanced to 4d6a708 via 7364d52 and 4d6a708. Resumed the claim to verify this new combined head. Merging preserves its Git sync fencing, awaited CLI diagnostics, fixture cleanup and review-r6 regressions plus our resource model/exclusions. The sole conflict is the src/swarm.ts import list; resolution retains RESOURCE_TAG, StaleFenceError and Lease. Prior green CI remains evidence only for f340c88. Fresh targeted integration checks and full CI will certify the combined head; no claim of unchanged package inputs is carried forward."
  "2026-10-21T21:28:00.528Z",codex-agent,"Latest-prerequisite integration checks passed: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"tracker|expired|validation|backend|records\" test/resources.test.ts test/review-r6.test.ts passes 6/6 (five resource scenarios and one matching upstream expiry scenario); the complete PM-linked node --test test/review-r6.test.ts passes 8/8 in 6428 ms. Zero failures/skips/cancellations. Typecheck, lint, docstrings (27 authored files, 81 declarations) and zero duplication also pass. Import conflict resolved by retaining both upstream lease imports and RESOURCE_TAG. Full combined-head CI follows."
  "2026-10-21T21:36:51.992Z",codex-agent,"Combined-source CI passed on ecda51c837a0db249d0f9852c0d18fbdd374d9f8: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/39679043493. Node 22 npm, Node 26 npm, and complete bun run release:check each pass 199/199 source tests plus 3/3 packed acceptance, zero failures/skips/cancellations. All 27 authored files meet 100/100/100/100 thresholds; all remaining gates pass, zero production vulnerabilities, package shasum 9ea1994a4c840ee46383a662a8a9b4d0a1356aef. Fresh combined-source public corpus validation also passes 1/1: 146 items, 300 read-only files, 3689055 bytes, 7 resource mutations, busy/stale refusals 1/1, final generation 4, JSON 89 bytes, zero changed baseline hashes, coordination/read 3641 ms. Latest #12 head 2fadac3 contains only its verification and tracker claim-release evidence and merges cleanly; published package inputs are unchanged from ecda51c. Final-head CI will be linked in PR #15. Release our claim, retain in-progress status; no PR merge or release, no new PM CLI/SDK defect."
  "2026-10-21T21:41:51.089Z",codex-agent,"Final example verification found an authored documentation error: the pinned host accepts --tags, not --tag. Corrected README resource provisioning and strengthened the existing Git-free native CLI case to provision its resource using that exact documented command before exercising leases. Resource application functions are unchanged; this is not a PM CLI/SDK defect. Reclaimed the item for this correction and fresh exact-head CI. Prior CI receipts retain their source provenance."
  "2026-10-21T21:42:56.368Z",codex-agent,"Corrected provisioning example passes the actual Git-free CLI chain: pm test pm-swarm-resource-reservations --run --only-index 2 --progress, executing node --test --test-name-pattern=CLI test/resources.test.ts, passes 1/1 in 33564 ms with zero failures/skips/cancellations. The test now creates the tagged resource through native pm create --tags before reservation. Typecheck and lint pass. Corrected-head full CI follows; no application resource function changes."
  "2026-10-21T21:49:21.664Z",codex-agent,"Corrected native provisioning/package head 8d19bc962af1c9c17f78d7a3b8a47baba375df2d passes full CI: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/39681059999. Node 22 npm, Node 26 npm and complete bun run release:check each pass 199/199 source tests plus 3/3 packed acceptance, zero failures/skips/cancellations. The suite now provisions a real non-Git resource via documented pm create --tags before the fenced CLI loop. All 27 authored files retain 100/100/100/100 coverage; strict tracker health and every remaining gate pass, zero production vulnerabilities. All package dry runs have corrected shasum 5ae8a94438429b5d0eaa2a8a4a639e205c496f38. Final receipt commit is docs and append-only PM evidence only; release claim and retain in-progress status. Final-head run will be linked in PR #15. No new PM CLI/SDK bug, PR merge or release."
  "2026-10-22T21:20:21.726Z",codex-agent,"Restack requested after PR #12 follow-up. The resource branch is clean and matches its remote head. Merge origin/main first, regenerating only the conflicting generated changelog from the merged tracker. Then merge verified prerequisite head 060c4076bc4e5b9f8b69bf69c1090e552b03626a; preserve resource exclusions alongside Git pin policy, reclaim parent/dry-run controls and recovery regressions. PR #12 final-head CI 39854899571 passes npm Node 22/26 and full Bun, each 246 source plus 3 packed tests with unchanged full coverage. Run combined resource/fencing regressions and complete npm/Bun CI before final handoff."
  "2026-10-22T21:23:14.299Z",codex-agent,"Conflict resolution keeps RESOURCE_TAG exclusions and recoverySnapshotMatches in SharedTracker, plus all upstream parent, marker, workflow and dry-run guards. Swarm retains RESOURCE_TAG with StaleFenceError/withSwarmLease and drops the obsolete retryLock import. Strengthen the existing resource exclusion test: use a foreign resource owner, age its real heartbeat, and require both preview and applied stale-agent reclaim to leave resource owner/history intact. This prevents fresh caller heartbeats from masking a missing resource filter. Run the combined linked resource, new fencing, and Git sync regressions, then prove that removing only the resource reclaim filter fails."
  "2026-10-22T21:26:45.048Z",codex-agent,"The isolated resource reclaim-filter proof fails 0/1, exit 1, zero skips/cancellations, at the preview assertion: removing only row.tags.includes(RESOURCE_TAG) proposes returning the held slot to the work pool. The current test uses a foreign owner and stale actual heartbeat and checks both preview and mutation preserve owner/history. Exact command and source-copy evidence are recorded in docs/resource-verification.md under Prerequisite refresh on 060c407. Combined typecheck, lint, build, docstrings (28 files, 85 declarations) and zero duplication (0/6184 lines across 59 sources) pass. No working source is reverted and no SDK response is mocked."
  "2026-10-22T21:31:18.426Z",codex-agent,"Combined PM-linked regression run completes 27/28, no skips/cancellations, 301569 ms. The sole failure is the unchanged native resource CLI case: its final release correctly refuses an expired token after a 185562 ms scenario with an explicit 120-second renewal. Every resource SDK/process/exclusion and prerequisite round-12/Git sync case passes. A focused CLI retry is running unchanged; full dedicated-runner npm/Bun CI must validate this timing-sensitive scenario before acceptance. No TTL, assertion or existing deadline is changed. The failed local run remains failed evidence, while the reclaim-filter negative proof is 0/1 as expected."
  "2026-10-22T21:32:40.879Z",codex-agent,"The unchanged native CLI retry passes 1/1, exit 0, no skips/cancellations, 121993 ms total and 116915 ms case time. The earlier combined 27/28 result remains a failed run; the sole failing case now has an unchanged successful retry. Main merge e04d441 and prerequisite merge 1e5b2a2 retain origin/main and #12 head 060c407 as ancestors. Strict tracker health passes with no pending merge receipts; no reconciliation, history repair or re-anchor is required. Full combined-head npm/Bun CI follows; claimed acceptance is still pending that complete gate."
  "2026-10-22T21:43:31.998Z",codex-agent,"Full combined-head CI 39858167503, attempt 1, passes e0ce509b71f5092e93089ed74119e336642ff3ca. Node 22 npm release steps, Node 26 npm release steps and complete Bun release each pass 253/253 source plus 3/3 packed npm/native Bun acceptance, with zero failures/skips/cancellations. All four coverage dimensions remain 100 percent across 28 authored files; strict clean-clone health, identity/privacy, typecheck, lint, zero duplication, 85 documented declarations, zero production vulnerabilities, package contents, changelog and publish attestation pass. The unchanged resource CLI case, strengthened resource reclaim exclusion and slow Git prerequisite cases pass in every execution. Existing local 27/28 failure and unchanged CLI 1/1 retry retain their provenance. New reclaim-filter revert proof fails 0/1 as expected. Release the claim, retain in-progress status and preserve append-only history; final receipt head has no application/package input changes and will receive its own CI."
  "2026-10-22T22:15:35.221Z",codex-agent,"Second prerequisite refresh: PR #12 received two late valid review threads after the first restack. Its corrected final receipt 0f5fbdcc14b5ab339a629d94f0a0f85eabd807d2 now passes CI 39862491701: npm Node 22/26 and full Bun each 248 source plus 3 packed, all four coverage dimensions 100 percent. Pull the clean resource remote head, preserve main ancestry, merge that verified correction, retain resource exclusions alongside the invoking-principal guard, run focused real resource/preview/document checks, repeat the reclaim-filter revert proof against the combined logic, and validate complete npm/Bun gates before releasing this claim again."
  "2026-10-22T22:21:18.224Z",codex-agent,"Second refresh combines verified #12 head 0f5fbdc with the resource branch. The sole reclaim conflict retains the RESOURCE_TAG exclusion and the new invoking-principal guard before marker/workflow/snapshot checks. PM-linked focused command covering own preview/apply, current verification introduction and resource exclusions passes 3/3, no failures/skips/cancellations, 22241 ms. Fresh resource-only filter revert retains the new self guard and fails 0/1, exit 1, no skips/cancellations; the foreign resource-owner fixture prevents either liveness or own-claim preservation from masking the filter. Typecheck/lint/build/docstrings pass, 28 source files and 85 declarations, duplication 0/6224 across 60 sources. The dependency pin, thresholds, TTLs and existing deadlines remain unchanged. Exact commands and proof are in docs/resource-verification.md under Late prerequisite refresh on 0f5fbdc. Full updated-head npm/Bun CI follows."
  "2026-10-22T22:29:34.873Z",codex-agent,"Latest combined-head CI 39864363092, attempt 1, passes 899e3cd331e518196f32b0c0a56a18c45275ac4e. npm Node 22, npm Node 26 and complete Bun release each pass 255/255 source plus 3/3 packed acceptance, zero suite failures/skips/cancellations. Four coverage dimensions remain 100 percent across 28 authored files; strict health, identity/privacy, typecheck, lint, duplication 0/6224 across 60 sources, 85 documented declarations, zero production vulnerabilities, package contents, changelog and publish attestation pass. The own-claim preview/apply/document corrections, resource exclusions, slow Git cases and unchanged resource CLI all pass. Focused integration is 3/3; resource-only filter revert with self guard retained is 0/1 as expected. Release the claim without closing the item. Final receipt leaves application/package inputs unchanged and receives its own CI. Main and corrected #12 head 0f5fbdc remain ancestors; threads are untouched and no PR/release is performed."
